{
  "_readme": [
    "One entry per county. Set 'url' to the county clerk's published tax deed surplus list",
    "(search the clerk's site for 'surplus', 'excess proceeds', or 'unclaimed funds'),",
    "set 'format' to csv, html or pdf, map 'columns' to that list's header names",
    "(a list of names = try each), then set enabled to true.",
    "Fields: case_number, parcel_id, owner_name, amount, sale_date, address.",
    "Check each site's terms of use. Some counties only provide lists on request - use a",
    "public records request and save the file locally, then point 'url' at the file path."
  ],
